<SiteHeader />

<section class="page-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Cruise Transportation</p>
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">PortMiami &amp; Port Everglades</p>
<h1 class="display">Timed to embarkation, not to a rough estimate.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Cruise-day traffic around both ports is predictable if you've done it before — the terminal you need, the drop lane that's actually open, and the timing that avoids the worst of the turnaround crowd.</p>
<div class="page-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call now</a>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a>
</div>
<p class="trust-line">+1 786 931 ONYX (6699) · Licensed &amp; insured · Miami-Dade Permit #64666 · D-U-N-S&reg; 13-860-0693</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">PortMiami</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Multiple cruise terminals along the same port road, each with its own drop sequence on a turnaround morning. From Brickell or Downtown, the approach over the MacArthur Causeway is a different drive on a ship's departure day than on any other — timed accordingly, not guessed at.</p>
</div>
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Port Everglades</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Fort Lauderdale's port draws heavy traffic from FLL arrivals stacking with cruise embarkation on the same mornings. Terminal assignment and luggage handling are confirmed before pickup, not sorted out curbside.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-dark">
<div class="wrap split center">
<div class="prose reveal">
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">What's included</p>
<h2 class="h2">Door to terminal, luggage handled.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<ul class="points">
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Terminal-aware drop-off.</b> The right terminal on the right road, not a generic "PortMiami" pin.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Luggage handling.</b> From the vehicle to the terminal curb.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Fixed fare, confirmed before pickup.</b> No adjustment for turnaround-day traffic.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Return transfers.</b> Same standard on disembarkation day, coordinated around your ship's actual clearance time.</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="feat-img reveal"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="suburban-side.avif" /><img src="suburban-side.webp" alt="Onyx Executive Miami Chevrolet Suburban for PortMiami and Port Everglades cruise transfers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1100" height="825" /></picture></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="eyebrow">Related</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:30px">Often booked with</h2>
<div class="related reveal">
<a href="airport-transfers.html"><div class="rk">Airports</div><h3>Airport transfers</h3></a>
<a href="brickell-downtown-miami.html"><div class="rk">Nearby</div><h3>Brickell &amp; Downtown Miami</h3></a>
<a href="fort-lauderdale.html"><div class="rk">Nearby</div><h3>Fort Lauderdale</h3></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap">
<h2 class="h2">Confirm your sailing date.</h2>
<p>Share your ship, terminal, and time — we'll confirm a fixed fare before you book.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call +1 786 931 ONYX (6699)</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a></div>
</div></section>
<SiteFooter />
<div class="mbar"><a href="tel:+17869316699">Call</a><a href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></div>
<YearReveal />
<SiteScripts />
</Base>
